<title>USA: Active Voice to buy back 100,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Active Voice to buy back 100,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Active Voice Corp said Wednesday its board had authorized the repurchase of 100,000 shares.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be made in the open market, it said.</p>
<p>&quot;At the current price levels and with the recent signing of our new strategic relationship with Siemens Business Communication Systems Inc, we believe our stock is an attractive opportunity for the company,&quot; Active Voice said.</p>
</text>
